# Third-party content

The work original to this repository is MIT licensed; see LICENSE. Of the 218 files
under `account/claude/`, 153 are third-party or derived from third-party work, and
those carry the terms below rather than the MIT licence.

The account layer is generated by `install/Export-Account.ps1` from a workstation's
`~/.claude/` tree, so these directories arrived there by installation rather than by
being authored here. They are redistributed so a second machine comes up configured
the same way.

## Security skill knowledge bases

`account/claude/skills/owasp-agentic/`, `owasp-cicd/`, `owasp-infrastructure/`,
`owasp-llm/`, `owasp-mcp/`, `owasp-top-10/` and `secure-by-design/`. 85 files.

All seven trees come from `microsoft/hve-core`, which each `SKILL.md` names in its
description. They were installed from there rather than derived from the primary
sources directly, and each tree records its own upstream in a `content_based_on`
frontmatter field.

The six OWASP trees, 72 files, carry `license: CC-BY-SA-4.0` and name the OWASP
Foundation as author. Content derived from works by the OWASP Foundation, licensed
under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). ShareAlike
applies: adaptations of this material distributed onward must carry the same licence.

`secure-by-design/`, 13 files, carries `license: OGL-UK-3.0 AND CC-BY-4.0`. Content
derived from works by the UK Government Security Group (Crown Copyright) licensed
under the Open Government Licence v3.0
(https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/), and by
the Australian Signals Directorate / ACSC (© Commonwealth of Australia) licensed under
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Licence marking inside these trees is uneven, which this notice exists to cover. Each
tree's `SKILL.md` carries the SPDX `license:` field. Of the 85 files, 52 carry a
licence marker in the file itself; the 33 reference files under `owasp-cicd/`,
`owasp-infrastructure/` and `owasp-mcp/` carry none. Read the attribution here as
applying to all 85.

## vale-ai-tells

`account/claude/tools/prose-lint/styles/ai-tells/`, 63 files.

Redistribution of https://github.com/tbhb/vale-ai-tells at v1.21.2, pinned by
